## 6. JS Performance & Build Pipeline

### The Problem: Hundreds of HTTP Requests

In **developer mode**, every `require()` call triggers a **separate HTTP request** for each AMD module. A typical checkout page can have 100+ JS files loading individually.

```
Developer mode (no bundling):
  GET /pub/static/frontend/.../jquery.js         [150ms]
  GET /pub/static/frontend/.../underscore.js     [80ms]
  GET /pub/static/frontend/.../ko.js             [200ms]
  ... x100 more files ...

  Total: ~3-5 seconds just for JS
```

### Solution: Static Content Deploy + Optimization

```bash
# Deploy static content with JS minification
php bin/magento setup:static-content:deploy \
