### RequireJS Bundling

RequireJS has a built-in **optimizer (r.js)** that combines multiple AMD modules into a single bundle file:

```
Without bundling:                With bundling:
  require A -> 1 request           require A -> loads bundle.js (1 req)
  require B -> 1 request           require B -> already in bundle (0 req)
  require C -> 1 request           require C -> already in bundle (0 req)
  = 3 requests                     = 1 request total
```

#### Enabling Bundling in Magento

```xml
<!-- app/etc/config.php or via Admin: Stores > Config > Advanced > Dev -->
<!-- Stores > Configuration > Advanced > Developer > JavaScript Settings -->
```

